            "answer_2": "<p>Standard shipping typically takes 5-7 business days. Express shipping options are available at checkout for faster delivery.</p>",
            "question_3": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Yes, we ship to most countries worldwide. International shipping times vary by destination and typically take 10-15 business days.</p>",
