            "answer_5": "<p>We accept all major credit cards, PayPal, Apple Pay, and Google Pay for your convenience.</p>",
            "question_6": "How do I choose the right jewelry for everyday wear?",
            "question_6": "How do I choose the right jewelry for everyday wear?",
            "answer_6": "<p>Choose jewelry that matches your daily style, feels comfortable, and is easy to care for. Simple gold rings, diamond earrings, pendants, and lightweight bracelets are popular choices for regular wear.</p>",
            "question_7": "What should I check before buying diamond jewelry?",
            "answer_7": "<p>Check the diamond's cut, color, clarity, carat weight, certification, and overall setting. It is also important to choose a trusted jewelry manufacturer or supplier who can provide clear product details.</p>",
            "question_8": "What is the difference between natural and lab-grown diamonds?",
            "answer_8": "<p>Natural diamonds are formed naturally inside the earth, while lab-grown diamonds are created using advanced technology in controlled conditions. Both can have the same basic chemical and physical properties, but their origin and pricing are different.</p>",
            "question_9": "Which gold purity is best for jewelry?",
            "answer_9": "<p>The right gold purity depends on how you plan to wear the jewelry. 14K and 18K gold are popular for everyday and fine jewelry because they offer a good balance of gold content, durability, and appearance.</p>",
            "question_10": "Can jewelry be customized according to my design?",
            "answer_10": "<p>Yes, jewelry can be customized based on your preferred design, metal, stone, size, and other details. Anirudh Jewels offers custom jewelry manufacturing and CAD-based design support for individual and business requirements.</p>",
            "question_11": "How should I take care of my gold and diamond jewelry?",
            "answer_11": "<p>Keep jewelry away from harsh chemicals, perfumes, lotions, and unnecessary moisture. Store each piece separately and clean it gently with a soft cloth to help maintain its shine.</p>",
            "question_12": "How can I choose the right diamond ring for an engagement?",
            "answer_12": "<p>Start with your budget, preferred metal, diamond shape, ring style, and the wearer's personal taste. For the diamond itself, compare the cut, color, clarity, carat, and certification before making a final choice.</p>",
            "question_13": "Are gemstones suitable for everyday jewelry?",
            "answer_13": "<p>Many gemstones can be used for everyday jewelry, but their durability differs. Consider the stone's hardness, setting, and care requirements before choosing a gemstone ring, bracelet, pendant, or earrings</p>",
            "question_14": "Can jewelry manufacturers make products for wholesale and private-label brands?",
            "answer_14": "<p>Yes. Jewelry manufacturers can produce collections for wholesalers, retailers, designers, and private-label brands. Anirudh Jewels provides custom manufacturing, private-label support, flexible MOQs, and bulk production for B2B buyers.</p>",
            "question_15": "What information should I provide when ordering custom jewelry?",
            "answer_15": "<p>Share your design or reference image, preferred metal, gemstone or diamond details, size, quantity, budget, and any special requirements. Providing clear specifications helps the manufacturer create the jewelry according to your expectations.</p>",
